  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: Well, now I just need to find out how those things are relevant, if they
      even are.
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Okay, so all clues point to one conclusion: that the ghost was most likely
      a victim of bullying[NS8.1]. Maybe they couldn\u2019t take it anymore? I honestly
      can\u2019t fault them for that, Bradley and his band of jerks are truly vicious.
      Hell, I\u2019ve even thought about it before a few times too, but to really
      go through with it.. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 2
    text: 'This line of thinking only gives you a headache, so you quickly shake
      your head to get rid of the unwanted distraction. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Whatever, this isn\u2019t about me right now. What matters now is to find
      out what happened. If my theory is correct, Bradley, Lacey and Lucas were probably
      hounding that poor person like hell. Problem here is that pretty much everyone
      in this school has had at least one unpleasant encounter with them.. But if
      it got bad enough that they took their own life, then it must\u2019ve been
      one of their particularly bad cases\u2026 "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 2
    text: "You try to think back to all the other people you can remember being especially
      targeted, but find that you don\u2019t really remember their names. After all,
      you had your own stuff to deal with and couldn\u2019t really afford the luxury
      to worry too much about the others, not when it could potentially get you into
      even more trouble. Thus, the first people that come to mind are the people
      you heard about today."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Hmm. So right now, the people on my list are that guy one year under us
      and.. what was her name? Ah, yeah, Veronica. They both had shit happen to them,
      and they weren\u2019t in school, which means they could potentially be the
      ghost..."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "I\u2019ll see if I can find out more about this tomorrow, but for now
      my head is swimming from all that thinking. Let\u2019s go get some sleep."
    videoEventId: 
